<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">To obtain a balanced yet representative evaluation set, we applied a stratified sampling scheme. Table <a href="#A1.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ A.1 Action Type Distributions ‣ Appendix A Appendix: Dataset Statistics and Sampling Strategy ‣ Say One Thing, Do Another? Diagnosing Reasoning-Execution Gaps in VLM-Powered Mobile-Use Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> shows the resulting distribution after sampling 200 instances from each dataset while preserving diversity across action types.</p>
</div>
