<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Appendix: Models Deployment</h2>

<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">AgentCPM-GUI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib56" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al., 2025f</a>)</cite>.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This model family adopts a single-turn format without history:</p>
<table id="A2.E9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="P(c_{n},a_{n}\mid I,o_{n})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P(c_{n},a_{n}\mid I,o_{n}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">which is equivalent to setting <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{n}=\varnothing" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{n}=\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="179.15" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 179.15" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,179.15) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 173.24 C 0 176.5 2.64 179.15 5.91 179.15 L 544.09 179.15 C 547.36 179.15 550 176.5 550 173.24 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 155.04 L 548.03 155.04 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 163.63)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">AgentCPM-GUI Data Examples</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 17.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:9.11em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="129.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 125.99)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="23.96" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 506.69 23.96" width="506.69"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,23.96) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(-19.69,0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 23.96 L 546.06 23.96 L 546.06 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.97 L 0 21.99 L 546.06 21.99 L 546.06 1.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 19.68 8.6)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">System Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
