<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">UI-TARS <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">Qin et al., 2025</a>)</cite>.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This model family organizes the task as a multi-turn dialogue, retaining at most the last <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> interaction triples in the context. Specifically,</p>
<table id="A2.E10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{n}=\{(o_{j},c_{j},a_{j})\}_{j=\max(1,\,n-N)}^{\,n-1}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{n}=\{(o_{j},c_{j},a_{j})\}_{j=\max(1,\,n-N)}^{\,n-1},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=4</annotation></semantics></math> in our setting. The model predicts</p>
<table id="A2.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E11.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="P(c_{n},a_{n}\mid I,H_{n},o_{n})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P(c_{n},a_{n}\mid I,H_{n},o_{n}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="306.52" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 306.52" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,306.52) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 300.61 C 0 303.88 2.64 306.52 5.91 306.52 L 544.09 306.52 C 547.36 306.52 550 303.88 550 300.61 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 282.41 L 548.03 282.41 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 291.01)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
