<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Benchmark results on AITZ, CAGUI, and AndroidControl datasets. Best results are marked in bold face. Overall, AgentCPM-GUI shows leading performance on AITZ and CAGUI, while UI-TARS achieves the strongest results on AndroidControl.</figcaption>
